+|---|---|---|---|
+| **q6_K q8_1 MMVQ route** | AMD, **n=7,8 only**, **MUL_MAT only** | **+5% to +40% per q6_K verify column**; **58/60 paired rounds won** across five shapes; **worst single round 0.9894** | `GGML_ARIFI_Q6K_MMVQ=legacy` |
